# Evolution: Candidates

Spec: CandidatesIndex
Purpose:
  Index of proposed concepts, skills, and decisions awaiting validation.
  Candidates are sourced from AI discovery, prompt analysis, and skill
  import pipeline. Each candidate must progress through the evolution
  pipeline (OBSERVED → CANDIDATE → VALIDATED → ESTABLISHED).

Owns: evolution/candidates/

Structure:
  Candidates are .sdd files with @candidate.CXXX IDs.
  Status field: pending-analysis | awaiting-evidence | under-review | rejected

Rules:
  [CAND-01] Every candidate MUST carry evidence_count and provenance.
  [CAND-02] Candidates MUST NOT be referenced as canonical knowledge.
  [CAND-03] Candidates age out after 30 days without promotion.

Navigation:
  Parent: @../INDEX.sdd
  Discovery: @../discovery.sdd
  ImportPlan: @../import-plan.sdd
  Proposals: @../proposals/INDEX.sdd
  Approved: @../approved/INDEX.sdd
  EvolutionPolicy: @../../policies/evolution.sdd

State: +
